CHAPTER.VERS:
And Samson said to them, If you

          {+}
         act after this manner, surely I will be avenged of you

          {+}
        , and after that I will cease.

And the men of Judah said, Why have you

          {+}
         come up against us? And they said, we have come up to bind Samson, to do to him as he has done to us.

And they said to him, We have come down to bind you, that we may deliver you into the hand of the Philistines. And Samson said to them, Swear to me, or else you

          {+}
         will fall on me yourselves.
